  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Personalized Adjusted Training </h2>",
   "body": "<p>Do you want to stay up to date with the latest technological developments? Do you want to get the most out of ZOLLER technology? Do you need assistance running measuring programs? Are you interested in a tool management system, or do you simply want to explore new options? Then join one of our training courses!</p> <p>The training sessions take place either at a ZOLLER branch or at your location. To ensure maximum learning success, the number of participants is limited to a maximum of 5. </p> <p><strong>Required course content?</strong> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/company/contact\" title=\"Kontakt zu ZOLLER\"><strong>Just</strong></a><br/><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/company/contact\" title=\"Kontakt zu ZOLLER\"><strong>ask us!</strong></a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/6/0/csm_training_05_55dada2a8d.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1200,
     "h": 1010
